{"id":"00189","root":"uni00189_1","name":{"ja":"メルシー","en":"Merci"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"メルシー","en":"Merci"},"aliases":["Mercy"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-04-30","limited":false,"characterId":149,"profile":{"ja":"妖精ケットシーになった元・メスの猫。猫だった頃は、不愛想な老婆に拾われ、ただ“猫”とそっけなく呼ばれながらも世話になっていた。老婆はかつて裕福だったが、詐欺によって全財産を失い、人間不信となり、最後は借金を負わされたまま路上で凍死した。主を失った猫もそのまま死に至るかと思われたが、人間界に紛れていた妖精ケットシーに助けられて魔界に行き、妖精となった。名前はなく、ただ“猫”と呼ばれていたため、老婆が最後に呟いた言葉を自分の名前としている。しばらくはケットシーとして魔界にいたが、馴染めず、人間界に戻ってきた。妖精となって人間に近い姿を得てからは、色香を使って人を誘惑する楽しみも覚えた。老婆の影響か、金を集める事にも貪欲で、色香や魔族として得た力を用い人々から金を搾って回っている。魔族としての力で底上げされた高い身体能力を持ち、近接格闘を得意とするが、基本的には正面から戦わず相手を翻弄して逃げる。","en":"(Merci, she/her) A former female cat turned into a fairy kettsie. As a cat, she was taken in by a surly old woman who called her simply \"cat\" while caring for her. The woman had once been wealthy but lost everything to fraud, grew distrustful of humans, and eventually froze to death on the street while still in debt. The cat seemed destined to die too, but a fairy kettsie hiding in the Human Realm rescued her and brought her to the Demon Realm, where she became a fairy. Having no name and only being called \"cat,\" she adopted the last words the old woman whispered as her name. She spent some time as a kettsie in the Demon Realm but never fit in, so she returned to the Human Realm. As a fairy she gained a near-human form and learned to enjoy seducing people with her allure. Influenced by the old woman, she is also greedy for money, using her charm and demonic powers to extort gold from others. Her demonic abilities grant her heightened physical prowess; she excels at close-quarters combat but generally prefers to bewilder opponents and flee rather than fight head-on."},"illustrator":"相川亜利砂","voiceActor":"中家志穂","forms":[{"id":"uni00189_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[776,1552],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[122,244],"def":[83,166],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]